<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Feb forex reserves rise to $1.679 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Feb forex reserves rise to $1.679 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's foreign exchange reserves rose to $1.679 billion in February from $1.356 billion in January, the State (central) Bank of Pakistan said.  </p>
<p>Following is the monthly foreign exchange reserves holdings position in Pakistan:</p>
<p>(BLN DLRS)</p>
<p>				 FEBRUARY  JANUARY   FEBRUARY 1996</p>
<p> TOTAL			   1.679     1.356	  2.048</p>
<p> Forex in Pakistan	   0.521     0.466	  1.048</p>
<p> Forex outside Pakistan    0.480     0.201	  0.288</p>
<p> Gold coins and bullion    0.676     0.676	  0.704</p>
<p> Special Drawing Rights    0.002     0.013	  0.008</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
